!GLWindow
=========

Example 2: a spinning triangle in a desktop window. Move it, resize it, cover it up; close it to quit.

Built from window.c in the riscos-mesa devkit's examples folder; read the
comments in that file to see how it works.

Needs: RISC OS 5, an ARMv7 or later processor (Raspberry Pi 2, 3 or 4,
or a Cortex-A8/A9/A15 board), and SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport
from PackMan.

Licence: MIT (see LICENCES.txt in the devkit). Mesa, UnixLib and the
